<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Bing: site:gao.gov "W56KGY-17-R-0026"</title><link>http://www.bing.com:80/search?q=site%3agao.gov+%22W56KGY-17-R-0026%22</link><description>Search results</description><image><url>http://www.bing.com:80/s/a/rsslogo.gif</url><title>site:gao.gov "W56KGY-17-R-0026"</title><link>http://www.bing.com:80/search?q=site%3agao.gov+%22W56KGY-17-R-0026%22</link></image><copyright>Copyright © 2026 Microsoft. All rights reserved. These XML results may not be used, reproduced or transmitted in any manner or for any purpose other than rendering Bing results within an RSS aggregator for your personal, non-commercial use. Any other use of these results requires express written permission from Microsoft Corporation. By accessing this web page or using these results in any manner whatsoever, you agree to be bound by the foregoing restrictions.</copyright><item><title>Buc-ee’s or… Bussy?! - YouTube</title><link>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qR-JPqGj9wo</link><description>This hilarious moment comes from a Buc-ee’s skit where the store’s name gets mispronounced as “Bussy” 🤣.</description><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 23:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>we out here at bussy’s #buccees #gasstation | bucees | TikTok</title><link>https://www.tiktok.com/@zachbeeken/video/7296650614602255659</link><description>2715 Likes, 46 Comments. TikTok video from Zach Beeken (@zachbeeken): “we out here at bussy’s #buccees #gasstation”. bucees. original sound - Miss_Snowwolf_jku.</description><pubDate>Wed, 10 Jul 2024 15:15:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Viral video causes internet to uproar after woman mispronounces 'Buc-ee's'</title><link>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-2v0R-P7k5M</link><description>Viral video causes internet to uproar after woman mispronounces 'Buc-ee's' …...more</description><pubDate>Mon, 20 Jul 2026 05:38:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Buc-ee’s First Visit: 10/10 Bussy Moments | TikTok</title><link>https://www.tiktok.com/@kisses4dele/video/7635098235530398990</link><description>10/10 experience at Buc-ee’s — a first visit full of raw, memorable moments. From arriving and calling it a “bussy” to small, distinct actions, the visit reads like a short, honest travel snapshot.</description><pubDate>Sun, 12 Jul 2026 14:37:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Viral TikTok video shows a user pronouncing Buc-ee's incorrectly</title><link>https://www.expressnews.com/news/local/article/TikTok-Buc-ee-s-mispronounced-17276529.php</link><description>A TikToker mispronounced Buc-ee's as 'Bussy's' in a viral video. Texans stepped in to correct her.</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jun 2022 12:07:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Viral TikTok proves why you shouldn't mispronounce Buc-ee's</title><link>https://www.chron.com/news/houston-texas/article/Viral-TikTok-proves-why-you-shouldn-t-17277639.php</link><description>Texans are demanding respect for the sacred Buc-ee's name. A TikTok user recently visited a location of the popular Texas convenience store chain for her first time and documented the...</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jun 2022 23:56:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>TikTok of woman mispronouncing Buc-ee's goes viral</title><link>https://www.valleycentral.com/news/viral-video-causes-internet-to-uproar-after-woman-mispronounces-buc-ees/</link><description>Crazy Life of Ash grabbed the attention of many with the mispronunciation of the infamous convenience store, pronouncing Buc-ee’s as “Busey’s” instead of “Buck-ee’s.” The family...</description><pubDate>Wed, 08 Dec 2021 14:07:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Buc-ee's Lesson: Customers Remember More Than You Think</title><link>https://www.inc.com/peter-economy/buc-ees-has-millions-of-fans-heres-why-reputation-still-matters/91377761</link><description>Buc-ee's lawsuit with Mickey's highlights how business decisions can shape customer perception, reputation, and the story people tell.</description><pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 09:58:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Family Mispronounces Buc-ee's on TikTok and Texas Loses It</title><link>https://kixs.com/family-mispronounces-buc-ees-on-tiktok-and-texas-loses-it/</link><description>The video showed the family eating Beaver Nugget, checking out the famous tidy restrooms, and commenting on the obsession with the Buc-ee's logo. What stood out to most, is the pronunciation of the iconic store.</description><pubDate>Wed, 08 Jul 2026 11:14:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Buc-ee's Home Decor Mocked In Hilarious Viral TikTok - iHeart</title><link>https://www.iheart.com/content/2022-04-20-buc-ees-home-decor-mocked-in-hilarious-viral-tiktok/</link><description>"Hey y'all, we're at Busseys," the TikTok with nearly 3 million views starts out, purposefully pronouncing "Buc-ee's" wrong. The video then shows the girl group reading some of the home decor signs out loud in their best Texas accent.</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Nov 2025 22:15:00 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>